%% PROPOSED text request lifecycle
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Staff
  participant W as Ketu panel
  participant R as /admin/assistant
  participant RT as rules and resolvers
  participant L as LLM fallback
  participant P as policy
  participant X as executor
  participant A as existing /admin endpoint
  U->>W: type and Send
  W->>R: requests {client_request_id, text}
  R->>R: auth, feature gate, idempotent insert (RECEIVED)
  R->>RT: firewall screen, L1 nav, L2 rules, L3 slots
  alt no match or conflict
    RT->>L: one json_schema call (enum = permitted actions)
    L-->>RT: action_id and slot strings
  end
  RT->>P: action and resolved params
  P-->>R: AUTHORIZED or REJECTED
  alt R0
    R->>X: execute
  else R1 to R3
    R->>X: preview (reads only) and plan_hash
    X-->>W: NEEDS_CONFIRMATION card
    U->>W: Confirm
    W->>R: confirm {plan_hash}
    R->>X: recompute preview, compare hash
  end
  X->>A: dispatch with caller credentials
  A-->>X: 2xx, 4xx or timeout
  X->>A: verify read-back
  X-->>W: COMPLETED_VERIFIED, FAILED or UNKNOWN_OUTCOME
